Novel fuel injection strategies for PCCI operation of a heavy-duty                                                                                        T
turbocharged diesel engine
                                                                                                          ⁎
Sunil Kumar Pandeya,b, S.R. Sarma Akellab, R.V. Ravikrishnaa,
a
    Combustion and Spray Laboratory, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Indian Institute of Science, Bangalore, Karnataka 560012, India
b
